{"violation_type":{"id":"tx-tac-746-4103-b","jurisdiction":"TX","state":"TX","code_system":"Texas Administrative Code, Title 26, Ch. 746","original_code":"746.4103(b)","title":"Policies for Release of Children - Record Identity of Person (26 TAC §746.4103(b))","short_title":"Policies for Release of Children - Record Identity of Person","severities":{"medium_high":26},"facility_ids":["tx-hhsc-1320233","tx-hhsc-1421313","tx-hhsc-1032108","tx-hhsc-251299","tx-hhsc-1246999","tx-hhsc-1259407","tx-hhsc-94354","tx-hhsc-1364532","tx-hhsc-1259127","tx-hhsc-1304660","tx-hhsc-1236054","tx-hhsc-1289447","tx-hhsc-1120233","tx-hhsc-171925","tx-hhsc-922793","tx-hhsc-308277","tx-hhsc-297947","tx-hhsc-474308","tx-hhsc-170021","tx-hhsc-314330","tx-hhsc-114361","tx-hhsc-1330102","tx-hhsc-155177","tx-hhsc-159296","tx-hhsc-1327569","tx-hhsc-1355148"],"first_date":"2022-02-07","last_date":"2026-06-03","typical_finding":"Based on external documentation, the identify of a parent was not recorded during pick up.","finding_variants":[{"text":"Based on external documentation, the identify of a parent was not recorded during pick up.","count":1},{"text":"During the course of this investigation, it was determined that the operation staff did not follow their policy for release of children when a copy of the pick-up persons ID was not saved and placed in the child's file.","count":1},{"text":"Based on the evidence obtained, during the release of two students the identity of person picking up was not recorded.","count":1},{"text":"Based on the evidence obtained during a DFPS investigation, an authorized individual did not have their identification documented for the child's file prior to the child being released to the authorized individual.   The operation's policy for release of children does not include a system on how the identity of persons will be documented.","count":1},{"text":"Based on information gathered during investigation, the operation did not follow their policies for releasing children. It was determined that a  person was not properly identified during evening pick up.","count":1},{"text":"The caregivers were not recording the identity of people who were picking up children who the caregiver did not know.  They were also not verifying if the person was on the child's admission form as an authorized person to pick up the child.","count":1}],"topic":"supervision","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios","topic_evidence":"INFERRED","primary_severity":"medium_high","occurrence_count":26,"facility_count":26},"by_year":{"2022":8,"2023":11,"2024":3,"2025":2,"2026":2},"facilities":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1320233","name":"Big Blue Marble Academy LLC","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Friendswood","zip":"77546","address":"3001 W Bay Area Blvd","capacity":243,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"lat":29.52230526866,"lon":-95.161788790712,"inspections":53,"last_inspection":"2026-09-23","violations":52,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":39,"occurrences_of_type":1,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1421313","name":"Little Wishes and Big Dreams Playhouse Ltd","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"San Antonio","zip":"78259","address":"19274 Redland Rd","capacity":219,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"lat":29.620850479408,"lon":-98.462626825641,"inspections":53,"last_inspection":"2026-10-09","violations":29,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":25,"occurrences_of_type":1,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1032108","name":"Building Blocks Academy Hobby Airport","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Houston","zip":"77061","address":"7615 Morley St","capacity":177,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"lat":29.66130286999,"lon":-95.283026582536,"inspections":19,"last_inspection":"2025-12-04","violations":14,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":12,"occurrences_of_type":1,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-251299"