een to the center before.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026586857","facility_name":"First Step Learning Center"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-159296-i20230918-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4103-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-159296-i20230918","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-159296","date":"2023-09-18","original_code":"746.4103(b)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-10-13","finding":"Policies for Release of Children - Record Identity of Person: Based on the evidence obtained during the investigation, the operation did not obtain a copy of an individual's identification until after the child had been inappropriately released to this person and returned.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026589363","facility_name":"Pleasant Valley Baptist Church"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20230915-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4103-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20230915","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-474308","date":"2023-09-15","original_code":"746.4103(b)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-11-13","finding":"Policies for Release of Children - Record Identity of Person: During the course of the investigation, it was determined that caregivers did not ask for or obtain photo identification for a person that picked up a child in care.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026596851","facility_name":"Ora Belinda Schoolhouse Early Learning Center"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1364532-i20230818-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4103-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1364532-i20230818","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1364532","date":"2023-08-18","original_code":"746.4103(b)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 202